      55.15,
      489.59,
      298.2,
      552.66
    ],
    "text": "I, Kuragamage Don Lal Kantha, Minister of Agriculture, Livestock, Lands and Irrigation do hereby declare, under Sub-section (1) of Section 5 of the Land Acquisition Act, that the land described below is needed for a public purpose and will be acquired under the provisions of that Act.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.15,
      567.59,
      298.22,
      656.66
    ],
    "text": "An allotment of land depicted in the Advance Tracing No. GA/KEL/2020/581 dated 28.06.2021, prepared by the Surveyor-General, situated in the Village of Hunupitiya in the Grama Niladhari Division No. 256-B of Welegoda in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Kelaniya in the District of Gampaha in Western Province and bounded as follows:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
